# userpackages.readme
# Packages Used in Secure Document Viewer Project

---

## Frontend — Angular (doc-viewer)

| Package | Version | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| `@angular/core` | ^20.3.0 | Angular framework core |
| `@angular/common` | ^20.3.0 | Angular common utilities, pipes (DatePipe etc.) |
| `@angular/compiler` | ^20.3.0 | Angular template compiler |
| `@angular/forms` | ^20.3.0 | Angular forms support |
| `@angular/platform-browser` | ^20.3.0 | Browser platform support |
| `@angular/animations` | ^20.3.18 | Animations support (required by ng-zorro) |
| `@angular/router` | ^20.3.0 | Angular routing |
| `ng-zorro-antd` | ^20.4.4 | Ant Design UI components — Table, Button, Modal, Spin, Icon, Tag, Layout |
| `ngx-doc-viewer` | ^21.0.5 | Document viewer component — renders PDF, DOCX, XLSX, PPTX, images via Google / Office / URL viewers |
| `rxjs` | ~7.8.0 | Reactive programming — Observable-based HTTP calls |
| `zone.js` | ~0.15.0 | Angular change detection |
| `tslib` | ^2.3.0 | TypeScript runtime helpers |

### Frontend Dev Dependencies

| Package | Version | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| `@angular/cli` | ^20.3.22 | Angular CLI — ng serve, ng build |
| `@angular/build` | ^20.3.22 | Angular application builder |
| `@angular/compiler-cli` | ^20.3.0 | AOT compiler |
| `typescript` | ~5.9.2 | TypeScript language |

---

## Backend — Express Server (document-viewer)

| Package | Version | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| `express` | ^5.2.1 | HTTP server and API routing |
| `cors` | ^2.8.6 | Allow Angular dev server (port 4200) to call the API (port 3000) |
| `dotenv` | ^17.3.1 | Load environment variables from .env file |
| `axios` | ^1.13.6 | Fetch file bytes from Supabase signed URL as arraybuffer |
| `@supabase/supabase-js` | ^2.100.0 | Create short-lived signed URLs and access Supabase Storage |
| `@neondatabase/serverless` | ^1.0.2 | Query Neon PostgreSQL for document metadata |

---

## How to Install

### Frontend
```bash
cd doc-viewer
npm install
```

### Backend
```bash
cd document-viewer
npm install
```

---

## How to Run

### Build Frontend
```bash
cd doc-viewer
ng build
```

### Start Backend (serves API + built Angular app)
```bash
cd document-viewer
node server.js
# Open http://localhost:3000
```

### Development Mode (hot reload)
```bash
# Terminal 1
cd document-viewer
node server.js

# Terminal 2
cd doc-viewer
ng serve
# Open http://localhost:4200
```

---

## Environment Variables (.env in document-viewer/)

```
NEON_DATABASE_URL=your_neon_postgres_connection_string
SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=your_service_role_key
SUPABASE_BUCKET=your_bucket_name
PORT=3000
```
